Suppose you hit a monster with Mojo that is carrying a wand of 
cancellation.  The wand can explode due to the lightning damage, I 
suppose.  Will it cancel you, standing next to the monster?

Similar questions impose themselves concerning wands of polymorph and 
draining (or even lightning! but can a wand of lightning break due to an 
electric shock?).

